# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the combined tp4/window-next four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/window-next and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# H1 (AUDITED ATTACH, LEAN): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost-audit (the arm plus QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_AUDIT=1: the reference runs beside the selection, the merge and the keyed write on the live data and the two must agree byte for byte; a
# difference uses the reference's bytes and fails the arm). Host work only: no device audit, no trace or allocation change, so it costs a normal smoke. Tests: warmup, concurrent8_steady (both blocks and both quads: the
# quad-blocks smoke rule needs it) and eight 32k code users. READ, in order, stopping at the first failure: (1) ONE '[PINDIAG] round host engaged log=1 select=1 read=1 keyed=1 lean=1 audit=1' line, no 'refused', no 'declined';
# (2) c2_smoke_check clean (its round_host rules: the ledger a step with every field, SELECT and READ on 95% of the drafting steps, the keyed write on half of the verifies of a block, the feature guard skipped once 64 reads have
# passed, none of the lines LEAN drops, an '[ROUND-HOST-AUDIT] kind=select|merge|keyed equal=1' line for each lever and ZERO equal=0); (3) python3 scripts/ci/round_host_report.py summary <server log> --live 8.
# The four-live read of the round-host pack (concurrent4_steady, --live 4) is not in this lean path. Duration (estimate): 50 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k
